{"seq":1,"slug":"image-processing","title":"图像处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/real-world-applications/image-processing","wordCount":755,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"图像处理\">图像处理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>浏览器端图像处理是一条清晰的分工流水线：<strong>JS 解码 → WASM 处理 → Canvas 渲染</strong>。之所以把中间一环交给 WASM，是因为像素级操作本质是大量重复的数值计算，WASM 在此比 JS 快 2–10 倍，且计算越密集优势越明显；SIMD 进一步让一条指令同时处理 4 个像素（16 字节），但需在编译时启用 <code>+simd128</code>。数据交换靠 Canvas 的 <code>getImageData</code>/<code>putImageData</code>，而重活应放到 <strong>OffscreenCanvas + Worker</strong> 的后台线程，以免阻塞 UI。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"浏览器端图像处理架构\">浏览器端图像处理架构</h2><p>在浏览器中使用 WASM 进行图像处理，可以获得接近原生的性能，同时保持 Web 的便捷性和跨平台能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    INPUT[&quot;用户上传图片&quot;] --&gt; DECODE[&quot;JS: 解码为 ImageData&quot;]&#10;    DECODE --&gt; TRANSFER[&quot;传输像素到 WASM 内存&quot;]&#10;    TRANSFER --&gt; PROCESS[&quot;WASM: 像素处理&quot;]&#10;    PROCESS --&gt; RETURN[&quot;返回处理后的像素&quot;]&#10;    RETURN --&gt; RENDER[&quot;JS: 渲染到 Canvas&quot;]&#10;&#10;    PROCESS --&gt; RESIZE[&quot;缩放&quot;]&#10;    PROCESS --&gt; FILTER[&quot;滤镜&quot;]&#10;    PROCESS --&gt; COMPRESS[&quot;压缩&quot;]&#10;    PROCESS --&gt; CONVERT[&quot;格式转换&quot;]\">graph TD\n    INPUT[\"用户上传图片\"] --&gt; DECODE[\"JS: 解码为 ImageData\"]\n    DECODE --&gt; TRANSFER[\"传输像素到 WASM 内存\"]\n    TRANSFER --&gt; PROCESS[\"WASM: 像素处理\"]\n    PROCESS --&gt; RETURN[\"返回处理后的像素\"]\n    RETURN --&gt; RENDER[\"JS: 渲染到 Canvas\"]\n\n    PROCESS --&gt; RESIZE[\"缩放\"]\n    PROCESS --&gt; FILTER[\"滤镜\"]\n    PROCESS --&gt; COMPRESS[\"压缩\"]\n    PROCESS --&gt; CONVERT[\"格式转换\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function processImage(file: File): Promise&lt;ImageData&gt; {&#10;  const bitmap = await createImageBitmap(file);&#10;  const canvas = new OffscreenCanvas(bitmap.width, bitmap.height);&#10;  const ctx = canvas.getContext(&#39;2d&#39;)!;&#10;  ctx.drawImage(bitmap, 0, 0);&#10;  const imageData = ctx.getImageData(0, 0, bitmap.width, bitmap.height);&#10;&#10;  const wasmModule = await import(&#39;./pkg/image_wasm.js&#39;);&#10;  await wasmModule.default();&#10;&#10;  wasmModule.apply_filter(new Uint8Array(imageData.data.buffer), imageData.width, imageData.height);&#10;&#10;  return imageData;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processImage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">file</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> File</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ImageData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bitmap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createImageBitmap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(file);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> canvas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OffscreenCanvas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bitmap.width, bitmap.height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> canvas.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawImage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bitmap, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> imageData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getImageData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bitmap.width, bitmap.height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> wasmModule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./pkg/image_wasm.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wasmModule.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  wasmModule.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apply_filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(imageData.data.buffer), imageData.width, imageData.height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> imageData;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>体积影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯 JS Canvas</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>简单操作</td>\n<td>无额外依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WASM 自定义</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>特定算法</td>\n<td>数十 KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>libvips WASM</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>完整图像流水线</td>\n<td>数 MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sharp WASM</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>Node.js 服务端</td>\n<td>数 MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"像素级操作\">像素级操作</h2><p>WASM 在逐像素操作上的性能优势最为显著，尤其是涉及大量数值计算的滤镜。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn grayscale(pixels: &amp;mut [u8]) {&#10;    for chunk in pixels.chunks_exact_mut(4) {&#10;        let r = chunk[0] as f32;&#10;        let g = chunk[1] as f32;&#10;        let b = chunk[2] as f32;&#10;        let gray = (r * 0.299 + g * 0.587 + b * 0.114) as u8;&#10;        chunk[0] = gray;&#10;        chunk[1] = gray;&#10;        chunk[2] = gray;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn box_blur(pixels: &amp;mut [u8], width: u32, height: u32, radius: u32) {&#10;    let w = width as usize;&#10;    let h = height as usize;&#10;    let r = radius as usize;&#10;    let mut output = pixels.to_vec();&#10;&#10;    for y in 0..h {&#10;        for x in 0..w {&#10;            let mut sum_r = 0u32;&#10;            let mut sum_g = 0u32;&#10;            let mut sum_b = 0u32;&#10;            let mut count = 0u32;&#10;&#10;            let y_start = y.saturating_sub(r);&#10;            let y_end = (y + r + 1).min(h);&#10;            let x_start = x.saturating_sub(r);&#10;            let x_end = (x + r + 1).min(w);&#10;&#10;            for ky in y_start..y_end {&#10;                for kx in x_start..x_end {&#10;                    let idx = (ky * w + kx) * 4;&#10;                    sum_r += pixels[idx] as u32;&#10;                    sum_g += pixels[idx + 1] as u32;&#10;                    sum_b += pixels[idx + 2] as u32;&#10;                    count += 1;&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;&#10;            let idx = (y * w + x) * 4;&#10;            output[idx] = (sum_r / count) as u8;&#10;            output[idx + 1] = (sum_g / count) as u8;&#10;            output[idx + 2] = (sum_b / count) as u8;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pixels.copy_from_slice(&amp;output);&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn adjust_brightness(pixels: &amp;mut [u8], factor: f32) {&#10;    for chunk in pixels.chunks_exact_mut(4) {&#10;        chunk[0] = ((chunk[0] as f32 * factor).min(255.0)) as u8;&#10;        chunk[1] = ((chunk[1] as f32 * factor).min(255.0)) as u8;&#10;        chunk[2] = ((chunk[2] as f32 * factor).min(255.0)) as u8;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn grayscale(pixels: &#x26;mut [u8]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for chunk in pixels.chunks_exact_mut(4) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let r = chunk[0] as f32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let g = chunk[1] as f32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let b = chunk[2] as f32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let gray = (r * 0.299 + g * 0.587 + b * 0.114) as u8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        chunk[0] = gray;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        chunk[1] = gray;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        chunk[2] = gray;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn box_blur(pixels: &#x26;mut [u8], width: u32, height: u32, radius: u32) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let w = width as usize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let h = height as usize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r = radius as usize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut output = pixels.to_vec();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for y in 0..h {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for x in 0..w {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let mut sum_r = 0u32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let mut sum_g = 0u32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let mut sum_b = 0u32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let mut count = 0u32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let y_start = y.saturating_sub(r);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let y_end = (y + r + 1).min(h);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let x_start = x.saturating_sub(r);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let x_end = (x + r + 1).min(w);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            for ky in y_start..y_end {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                for kx in x_start..x_end {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    let idx = (ky * w + kx) * 4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    sum_r += pixels[idx] as u32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    sum_g += pixels[idx + 1] as u32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    sum_b += pixels[idx + 2] as u32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    count += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let idx = (y * w + x) * 4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            output[idx] = (sum_r / count) as u8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            output[idx + 1] = (sum_g / count) as u8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            output[idx + 2] = (sum_b / count) as u8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pixels.copy_from_slice(&#x26;output);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn adjust_brightness(pixels: &#x26;mut [u8], factor: f32) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for chunk in pixels.chunks_exact_mut(4) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        chunk[0] = ((chunk[0] as f32 * factor).min(255.0)) as u8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        chunk[1] = ((chunk[1] as f32 * factor).min(255.0)) as u8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        chunk[2] = ((chunk[2] as f32 * factor).min(255.0)) as u8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>滤镜</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>WASM vs JS 加速比</th>\n<th>SIMD 加速比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>灰度转换</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>2-3x</td>\n<td>4-8x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>亮度调节</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>2-3x</td>\n<td>4-8x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方框模糊</td>\n<td>O(n·r²)</td>\n<td>5-10x</td>\n<td>10-20x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高斯模糊</td>\n<td>O(n·r)</td>\n<td>5-10x</td>\n<td>10-20x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘检测</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>3-5x</td>\n<td>6-10x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直方图均衡</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>2-4x</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 对于简单的逐像素操作（如灰度转换），WASM 的加速效果有限（2-3x）。但对于涉及邻域计算的操作（如模糊），WASM 的性能优势会随计算复杂度增加而显著扩大。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"simd-加速\">SIMD 加速</h2><p>WASM SIMD（128 位向量指令）可以同时处理多个像素通道，大幅提升图像处理性能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[cfg(target_arch = &quot;wasm32&quot;)]&#10;use std::arch::wasm32::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn simd_brighten(pixels: &amp;mut [u8], amount: u8) {&#10;    #[cfg(target_arch = &quot;wasm32&quot;)]&#10;    {&#10;        let add_vec = u8x16_splat(amount);&#10;        let chunks = pixels.chunks_exact_mut(16);&#10;        for chunk in chunks {&#10;            let pixel_vec = v128_load(chunk.as_ptr() as *const v128);&#10;            let result = u8x16_add_sat(pixel_vec, add_vec);&#10;            v128_store(chunk.as_mut_ptr() as *mut v128, result);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn simd_invert(pixels: &amp;mut [u8]) {&#10;    #[cfg(target_arch = &quot;wasm32&quot;)]&#10;    {&#10;        let max_vec = u8x16_splat(255);&#10;        let alpha_mask = u8x16(255,255,255,0, 255,255,255,0, 255,255,255,0, 255,255,255,0);&#10;        let chunks = pixels.chunks_exact_mut(16);&#10;        for chunk in chunks {&#10;            let pixel_vec = v128_load(chunk.as_ptr() as *const v128);&#10;            let inverted = v128_xor(pixel_vec, alpha_mask);&#10;            v128_store(chunk.as_mut_ptr() as *mut v128, inverted);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(target_arch = \"wasm32\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::arch::wasm32::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn simd_brighten(pixels: &#x26;mut [u8], amount: u8) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[cfg(target_arch = \"wasm32\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let add_vec = u8x16_splat(amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let chunks = pixels.chunks_exact_mut(16);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for chunk in chunks {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let pixel_vec = v128_load(chunk.as_ptr() as *const v128);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let result = u8x16_add_sat(pixel_vec, add_vec);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            v128_store(chunk.as_mut_ptr() as *mut v128, result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn simd_invert(pixels: &#x26;mut [u8]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[cfg(target_arch = \"wasm32\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let max_vec = u8x16_splat(255);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let alpha_mask = u8x16(255,255,255,0, 255,255,255,0, 255,255,255,0, 255,255,255,0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let chunks = pixels.chunks_exact_mut(16);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for chunk in chunks {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let pixel_vec = v128_load(chunk.as_ptr() as *const v128);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let inverted = v128_xor(pixel_vec, alpha_mask);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            v128_store(chunk.as_mut_ptr() as *mut v128, inverted);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 标量处理&#10;        S1[&quot;像素 1&quot;] --&gt; P1[&quot;处理&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;像素 2&quot;] --&gt; P2[&quot;处理&quot;]&#10;        S3[&quot;像素 3&quot;] --&gt; P3[&quot;处理&quot;]&#10;        S4[&quot;像素 4&quot;] --&gt; P4[&quot;处理&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph SIMD 处理&#10;        V_IN[&quot;4 像素 (16 字节)&quot;] --&gt; V_PROC[&quot;单条指令&quot;]&#10;        V_PROC --&gt; V_OUT[&quot;4 像素结果&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 标量处理\n        S1[\"像素 1\"] --&gt; P1[\"处理\"]\n        S2[\"像素 2\"] --&gt; P2[\"处理\"]\n        S3[\"像素 3\"] --&gt; P3[\"处理\"]\n        S4[\"像素 4\"] --&gt; P4[\"处理\"]\n    end\n    subgraph SIMD 处理\n        V_IN[\"4 像素 (16 字节)\"] --&gt; V_PROC[\"单条指令\"]\n        V_PROC --&gt; V_OUT[\"4 像素结果\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SIMD 指令</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>图像处理用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>u8x16_add_sat</code></td>\n<td>饱和加法</td>\n<td>亮度增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>u8x16_sub_sat</code></td>\n<td>饱和减法</td>\n<td>亮度降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>v128_xor</code></td>\n<td>按位异或</td>\n<td>颜色反转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i16x8_mul</code></td>\n<td>16 位乘法</td>\n<td>滤镜权重计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>u8x16_avgr</code></td>\n<td>取平均</td>\n<td>快速模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i32x4_dot_i16x8</code></td>\n<td>点积</td>\n<td>卷积核计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 编译时启用 SIMD&#10;RUSTFLAGS=&quot;-C target-feature=+simd128&quot; \\&#10;  wasm-pack build --release --target web\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编译时启用 SIMD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RUSTFLAGS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-C target-feature=+simd128\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> WASM SIMD 在所有现代浏览器（Chrome 91+、Firefox 89+、Safari 16.4+）中已默认启用。编译时需要显式开启 <code>+simd128</code> feature flag，否则 Rust 编译器不会生成 SIMD 指令。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"canvas-集成\">Canvas 集成</h2><p>将 WASM 处理后的像素数据与 HTML Canvas API 集成，实现实时图像预览和编辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class ImageEditor {&#10;  private canvas: HTMLCanvasElement;&#10;  private ctx: CanvasRenderingContext2D;&#10;  private originalPixels: Uint8ClampedArray | null = null;&#10;  private wasmModule: any;&#10;&#10;  constructor(canvas: HTMLCanvasElement) {&#10;    this.canvas = canvas;&#10;    this.ctx = canvas.getContext(&#39;2d&#39;)!;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async init(): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    this.wasmModule = await import(&#39;./pkg/image_wasm.js&#39;);&#10;    await this.wasmModule.default();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async loadImage(src: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    const img = new Image();&#10;    img.src = src;&#10;    await img.decode();&#10;    this.canvas.width = img.width;&#10;    this.canvas.height = img.height;&#10;    this.ctx.drawImage(img, 0, 0);&#10;    this.originalPixels = this.ctx&#10;      .getImageData(0, 0, img.width, img.height)&#10;      .data.slice() as unknown as Uint8ClampedArray;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  applyFilter(filter: &#39;grayscale&#39; | &#39;blur&#39; | &#39;brighten&#39;, params?: any): void {&#10;    if (!this.originalPixels) return;&#10;    const pixels = new Uint8Array(this.originalPixels);&#10;&#10;    switch (filter) {&#10;      case &#39;grayscale&#39;:&#10;        this.wasmModule.grayscale(pixels);&#10;        break;&#10;      case &#39;blur&#39;:&#10;        this.wasmModule.box_blur(pixels, this.canvas.width, this.canvas.height, params?.radius ?? 3);&#10;        break;&#10;      case &#39;brighten&#39;:&#10;        this.wasmModule.adjust_brightness(pixels, params?.factor ?? 1.2);&#10;        break;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    const imageData = new ImageData(new Uint8ClampedArray(pixels), this.canvas.width, this.canvas.height);&#10;    this.ctx.putImageData(imageData, 0, 0);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImageEditor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> canvas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLCanvasElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CanvasRenderingContext2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> originalPixels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8ClampedArray</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span styl